0 Santa Fe Super Chief Baggage Car (set 10025-1) — a light grey and dark grey baggage train car with grilled side panels, glazed end windows, eight opening side doors with glass, a curved-arch roof, an interior with red minifig seats, a brown spindled fence and a yellow cup, SANTA FE lettering and 606 number stickers, and two single-axle wheel bogies with magnetic couplings
